Package: devjam-gpu-chromium-config
Version: 1.3-6
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: chromium
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: GPU acceleration flags for Chromium
 Default command line flags for Chromium in /etc/chromium.d that enable
 VA-API video decoding and encoding, GPU compositing and rasterization,
 and the Vulkan/ANGLE backend.
